// Bella's hello script.
// Demonstrates: plain narration, three branching choices, per-branch
// follow-up text, and ending the conversation.

Hi there! I'm Bella. Nice to finally meet you.
How are you feeling today?

* [I'm doing great, thanks!]
    Bella beams. "That's wonderful to hear! Keep that energy up."
    -> END

* [I've seen better days...]
    Bella's smile softens. "I'm sorry. Take care of yourself, alright?"
    Maybe come find me again later.
    -> END

* [None of your business.]
    Bella raises an eyebrow. "Well. Suit yourself."
    -> END
